An optional commercial whole-book companion to the free advanced spine. Read complete chapters and solve substantial problems when using it; compare notation, selected material models and radiation/relativity explanations with the freely available books. It is not required simply to enter this route.

The publisher's copyright leaf was inspected on 29 October 2026. Public front matter is not free access to the entire book, and the 2024 edition date should not be replaced by a guessed 2023 date. Obtain a licensed or library copy. No text, figures, solutions manual or unofficial PDF is supplied.

